r Resume'. After reloading the app (navigating to http://localhost:6005/), the dashboard reverted to the original 3 seed resumes (Software Engineer Resume, Marketing Manager Resume, Product Designer Resume) — the created resume, the duplicated/renamed copy, and the deletion were all lost, and the deleted resume reappeared.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-21\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No validation feedback on empty/whitespace rename\", \"actual\": \"Editing the resume title to a whitespace-only value and pressing Enter silently reverted the title back to 'Untitled Resume' with no error message, toast, or inline feedback shown to the user. The current title is preserved (correct), but there is no clear validation feedback as required.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-12\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Typing in contact/summary fields, switching templates, and section edits all reflected instantly in the Live Preview with no save/refresh action taken.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"After reordering/hiding sections, preview updated immediately; switching to Contact tab preserved the new order/visibility in preview.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Edited title and content, returned to dashboard (card showed updated title and 'Updated Aug 26, 2026'), reopened resume — all edits (title, contact, sections order/visibility, template) were retained.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"With 18 filled experience entries plus summary and skills, all visible sections with content rendered in the preview (hidden Education section correctly omitted); content overflowing the visible area (last item at ~2039px, viewport 720px) became visible after scrolling, confirming full resume is reachable via scroll.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"After navigating between tabs, returning to dashboard, and reopening the resume, contact details, summary, experience, education (hidden but content intact), and skills content all persisted exactly.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Edited copy's Full Name to 'Jane Doe (Copy Edit)' — original stayed 'Jane Doe'. Then edited original's Full Name to 'Jane Doe (Original Edit)' — reopened copy still showed 'Jane Doe (Copy Edit)', confirming two-way independence.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Renamed resume to 'Software Engineer Resume - Draft A' in editor; same title shown in editor header and on the dashboard card after navigating back.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-20\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Renamed Skills heading to 'Technical Skills' and Experience heading to 'Professional Experience' in Sections tab; both custom headings appeared correctly (case-adjusted per style) in Minimal, Modern, and Classic preview.\"}]}"
